    "detailed_description": "A free, Sega Saturn-inspired 3D fighting game. Soar through the sky and master your powerful techniques!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake on Kuro in intense battles with fast-paced, but easy-to-learn fighting controls! Master punches and unleash your ultimate attack to win every battle!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOriginally started as a junior-year college project focused on developing a game engine from scratch, this game is now maintained as a hobby. Stay tuned for updates, likely coming in mid-2025!",
